WEBVTT

00:20:59.742 --> 00:21:03.689
ka katra dzīve, ikviena no tām

00:21:03.689 --> 00:21:06.584
ir vienlīdz un bezgala svarīga.

00:21:06.584 --> 00:21:07.765
Liels paldies!

00:21:07.765 --> 00:21:10.775
(Aplausi)

00:21:10.775 --> 00:21:11.973
Paldies.

00:21:11.973 --> 00:21:14.559
(Aplausi)

00:21:17.199 --> 00:21:18.491
Paldies.